							"Portrait":0
						},
						{
							"Character":"Anna",
							"Text":"Each turn a squad ends on the city, it adds its strength to the flag, and 10 takes it: a full squad needs 2 turns, a hurt one longer. A squad that attacked that turn adds nothing. Watch the flag climb.",
							"Sound":"",
							"Portrait":0
						}
					],
